Credits
-------

Open-BFME (https://github.com/Open-BFME/Open-BFME-1, GPL-3.0)
  The reverse engineering behind Beacon builds on Open-BFME's reconstruction of
  the BFME1 engine (game behaviour, addresses, network protocol). The patch
  bundle in patches/openbfme-bundle.json is derived from Open-BFME's mod build
  and contains its GPL-3.0 code cave; see patches/README.md for the origin and
  the corresponding source.

Rust crates
  Beacon is built from many open-source Rust crates (listed in Cargo.lock).
  Each crate keeps its own license (mostly MIT and/or Apache-2.0).


